{"seq":3,"slug":"yard-slot-capacity-inventory","title":"堆场车位容量台账与暂存区（staging）库存可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/yard-operations-dock-model/yard-slot-capacity-inventory","wordCount":2746,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"堆场车位容量台账与暂存区-staging-库存可视化\">堆场车位容量台账与暂存区（staging）库存可视化</h1><p>园区的物理面积是固定的，但「今天能接多少台拖车」却是每天在变的。差别在于：能不能把堆场里的每一寸可用平面建模成一条<strong>有状态、有归属、可计量</strong>的库存记录。这篇文档讨论的就是这条记录——容量台账（capacity ledger）——以及它如何在暂存区层面被调度、被审计、被可视化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-车位是容量资源-不是坐标\">核心概念：车位是容量资源，不是坐标</h2><p>堆场最容易犯的建模错误，是把车位当成平面图上的一个坐标点。一旦这样建模，系统就只能回答「这个位置有没有车」，回答不了「下周二的 14:00 我还能不能接 40 台 53 英尺拖车」。前者的数据结构是 <code>(x, y, occupied)</code>，后者需要的是 <code>(资源类型, 时间窗, 容量, 已占用, 预留, 冻结)</code>。</p>\n<p>这些槽位并非孤立存在，它们镶嵌在园区的功能分区与动线之中（分区的整体切分方式见同章 <a href=\"yard-topology-trailer-flow-model\">堆场拓扑、功能分区与拖车货物流动模型</a>）。真正支撑月台调度的，是三个彼此独立的层次：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物理槽位（physical slot）</strong>：地面标线划出的具名停车位，带尺寸约束（45/48/53 英尺挂车、20/40 英尺集装箱）、承重、坡度、以及是否允许冷藏机组持续运行（reefer）。</li>\n<li><strong>逻辑槽位（logical slot / logical position）</strong>：一组物理槽位按用途聚合后的容量单元，例如「A 区空箱暂存 12 位」「危险品隔离 4 位」「海关查验暂扣 6 位」。逻辑槽位是<strong>库存台账记账的粒度</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>容量台账（capacity ledger）</strong>：记录每个逻辑槽位在时间轴上的可承诺量，是 YMS 向预约系统（appointment engine）承诺运力的唯一真相源。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[物理槽位&lt;br/&gt;标线/尺寸/承重/reefer] --&gt; B[逻辑槽位&lt;br/&gt;按用途聚合容量单元]&#10;  B --&gt; C[容量台账&lt;br/&gt;时间轴上的可承诺量]&#10;  C --&gt; D[预约系统&lt;br/&gt;可承诺量校验]&#10;  C --&gt; E[可视化看板&lt;br/&gt;占用率/热点/缺口]&#10;  C --&gt; F[暂存区调度&lt;br/&gt;选位与归位策略]\">graph TD\n  A[物理槽位&lt;br/&gt;标线/尺寸/承重/reefer] --&gt; B[逻辑槽位&lt;br/&gt;按用途聚合容量单元]\n  B --&gt; C[容量台账&lt;br/&gt;时间轴上的可承诺量]\n  C --&gt; D[预约系统&lt;br/&gt;可承诺量校验]\n  C --&gt; E[可视化看板&lt;br/&gt;占用率/热点/缺口]\n  C --&gt; F[暂存区调度&lt;br/&gt;选位与归位策略]</pre><p>一个 YMS 的台账之所以难，在于它必须同时满足两种互相拉扯的约束：<strong>预约系统要求的是「可承诺量」（promise）</strong>——提前数天锁定的数字，不能事后反悔；<strong>现场操作要求的是「实时可达量」（availability）</strong>——包括那些因为东侧闸口拥堵而实际上进不来的位。台账如果只记 promise，会在现场爆仓；如果只记 availability，预约就会超卖。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源类型</th>\n<th>承载对象</th>\n<th>典型容量单位</th>\n<th>变更成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>月台门（dock door）</td>\n<td>装卸作业</td>\n<td>门·小时</td>\n<td>极高（建筑结构）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暂存位（staging slot）</td>\n<td>待装/待卸挂车</td>\n<td>位·小时</td>\n<td>低（改标线即可）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停车位（parking slot）</td>\n<td>空箱/待命挂车</td>\n<td>位·天</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查验位（hold slot）</td>\n<td>海关/合规暂扣</td>\n<td>位</td>\n<td>中（需隔离围栏）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>变更成本这一列决定了管理策略：月台门是<strong>稀缺且刚性</strong>的，必须用排队论精算；暂存位是<strong>弹性</strong>的，靠动态重划和归位策略调节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量台账的数据模型与状态机\">容量台账的数据模型与状态机</h2><p>台账的基本单位是一条 slot inventory 记录。它不是一个「当前占用」字段，而是一条<strong>带生效区间的状态</strong>。每条记录形如：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"slot_inventory {&#10;  slot_id, zone_id, slot_class,        // A-12, STAGE_COLD, 53FT_DRY&#10;  window: [start, end],                 // 生效时间窗&#10;  state: AVAILABLE | RESERVED | OCCUPIED | BLOCKED | OUT_OF_SERVICE,&#10;  holder: { trailer_id?, appointment_id?, case_id? },&#10;  constraints: [reefer_power, hazmat_class, customs_hold],&#10;  version: 41                           // 乐观并发版本号&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>slot_inventory {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  slot_id, zone_id, slot_class,        // A-12, STAGE_COLD, 53FT_DRY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  window: [start, end],                 // 生效时间窗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  state: AVAILABLE | RESERVED | OCCUPIED | BLOCKED | OUT_OF_SERVICE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  holder: { trailer_id?, appointment_id?, case_id? },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  constraints: [reefer_power, hazmat_class, customs_hold],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  version: 41                           // 乐观并发版本号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>状态机的边必须被严格约束，否则会出现「一个位同时被两辆拖车认为可用」的双重承诺（double-booking）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; AVAILABLE&#10;  AVAILABLE --&gt; RESERVED: 预约确认&#10;  RESERVED --&gt; OCCUPIED: 闸口入场/落箱&#10;  RESERVED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 取消/超时释放&#10;  OCCUPIED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 提箱离场&#10;  OCCUPIED --&gt; BLOCKED: 扣留/查验&#10;  BLOCKED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 放行&#10;  AVAILABLE --&gt; OUT_OF_SERVICE: 维修/雪季/施工&#10;  OUT_OF_SERVICE --&gt; AVAILABLE: 恢复\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; AVAILABLE\n  AVAILABLE --&gt; RESERVED: 预约确认\n  RESERVED --&gt; OCCUPIED: 闸口入场/落箱\n  RESERVED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 取消/超时释放\n  OCCUPIED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 提箱离场\n  OCCUPIED --&gt; BLOCKED: 扣留/查验\n  BLOCKED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 放行\n  AVAILABLE --&gt; OUT_OF_SERVICE: 维修/雪季/施工\n  OUT_OF_SERVICE --&gt; AVAILABLE: 恢复</pre><p>两个细节容易被忽略。第一，<code>RESERVED → AVAILABLE</code> 的<strong>超时释放</strong>必须有时钟归属：到达窗结束后一个短宽限期（通常 30–60 分钟）无入场记录即自动释放，且释放事件要写入审计流，否则「为什么我的位没了」永远无法复盘。第二，<code>OCCUPIED</code> 不该由人手工点击，它的正确来源是<strong>不可否认的位置事件</strong>：闸口 OCR 车牌/箱号识别、GPS 地理围栏越界、UWB/RTLS 标签进入区域；人工点选只能兜底，并需打 source 标记，以便度量「有多少占用是靠猜的」。</p>\n<p>并发控制上，台账应使用乐观并发（记录里那个 <code>version</code> 字段）而不是悲观锁：调度器在低峰期会做批量重排（reshuffle），长事务持锁会让整个预约面停摆。冲突时让重排失败并回退，比让闸口排队更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暂存区-staging-的语义-闸口与月台之间的缓冲池\">暂存区（staging）的语义：闸口与月台之间的缓冲池</h2><p>暂存区的存在理由只有一个：<strong>解耦两个速率不匹配的过程</strong>。闸口放行是批量的（一列车队同时到达），月台装卸是单台的（一个门一次只能服务一台车）。没有暂存区，闸口必须按门速放行，园区入口就会变成瓶颈。</p>\n<p>因此在排队网络里，暂存区是一个<strong>缓冲区（buffer）</strong>，它的容量决定了整个园区的吞吐上限和车辆在园外的排队长度。这类系统用排队论描述最直接。设挂车到达率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>（台/小时），平均暂存停留时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（小时），则暂存区需要的位数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>staging</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{staging}} = \\lceil \\lambda \\cdot W \\rceil + B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">staging</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是安全缓冲位（吸收到达抖动和月台故障）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 由「等待可用门的时间 + 装卸时长 + 归位时间」构成。若把暂存区看成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 个并行的服务台、服务率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，则其利用率满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>ρ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> 才具备稳定态</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{\\lambda}{c\\,\\mu}, \\qquad \\rho &lt; 1 \\text{ 才具备稳定态}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">才具备稳定态</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 逼近 1 时，排队长度呈非线性爆炸（M/M/c 的等待时间随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 发散），这正是很多园区在旺季「明明还有空位却堵死」的数学原因：不是没有位置，而是位置被下游未及时清空的挂车占着。</p>\n<p>暂存区选位（slot assignment）有三条互相冲突的准则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>准则</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>就近（nearest-to-door）</td>\n<td>缩短拖车行驶距离</td>\n<td>热门区过早饱和，冷区闲置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分类隔离（class segregation）</td>\n<td>满足冷链/危险品/海关隔离</td>\n<td>降低可用位总量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后进先出优先（LIFO-friendly）</td>\n<td>减少二次倒箱（reshuffle）</td>\n<td>与就近冲突，需权衡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上的可行解是<strong>分层选位</strong>：先用约束过滤（隔离、电源、尺寸）得到合法位集合，再在该集合内用近似打分选择（距离归一化 + 阻塞代价）。切忌把三条准则做成一维加权和——权重的物理意义无法解释，调参也没有依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"占用率-容量缺口与超额承诺的量化\">占用率、容量缺口与超额承诺的量化</h2><p>台账的价值在于把「够不够」变成可计算量。最基本的三个指标是：</p>\n<p><strong>瞬时占用率</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>occupancy</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>occupied</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>reserved</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>out_of_service</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{occupancy}(t) = \\dfrac{\\text{occupied}(t) + \\text{reserved}(t)}{N_{\\text{total}} - N_{\\text{out\\_of\\_service}}(t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">occupancy</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.48em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out_of_service</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">occupied</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserved</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>峰值缺口</strong>：对一天内的预约承诺曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 逐分钟求差，缺口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_t (D(t) - C(t))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，而不是看日均。日均可承诺量掩盖的正是那一小时 40 台同时到场的尖峰。</p>\n<p><strong>车位周转率</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>turnover</mtext><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mtext>日吞吐台次</mtext><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{turnover} = \\dfrac{\\text{日吞吐台次}}{N_{\\text{total}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">turnover</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">日吞吐台次</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。周转率低而占用率高，说明有僵尸挂车滞留；周转率高而占用率也高，才是真的容量紧张。两个指标必须一起读。\n还有一个跨境场景特有的量——<strong>海关状态占位</strong>。被查验或暂扣的挂车其占位是「不可调度占位」，在台账里应显式标记为 <code>BLOCKED</code>，而非混入 <code>OCCUPIED</code>。把扣留量单列，才能算出真实的可运营容量。国际货运的海关滞留与滞期费争议（美国联邦海事委员会 FMC 于 2020 年 5 月生效的 Detention and Demurrage Interpretive Rule，Docket No. 19-04）要求承运人能证明费用计费与实际可用性一致，这让「不可调度占位」的时长记录从运营指标升级为<strong>计费证据</strong>。</p>\n<p>拉长时间的容量规划用 Little 定律做骨架：在库量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、平均停留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>。若旺季预估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 上升 30%，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 不变的前提下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 必须同步上升 30%——如果物理位加不出来，唯一出路是压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>。这条恒等式把「加地」和「提效」放进同一个等式，是容量论证时最有力的第一句话。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可视化-从静态平面图到实时数字孪生\">可视化：从静态平面图到实时数字孪生</h2><p>可视化的第一原则不是好看，是<strong>让决策发生在正确的时间尺度上</strong>。同一个堆场需要三种视图，对应三种决策节奏：<strong>秒级看板</strong>（闸口大屏空位热力图，引导司机，新鲜度 &lt; 30 秒，绝不能显示已被承诺的位）、<strong>小时级视图</strong>（当日各时段占用率曲线 + 预计缺口，用于临时加班或引导改约）、<strong>天/周级视图</strong>（占用率日历热力图，用于发现结构性而非当天的容量问题）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  G[闸口 OCR/GPS 事件] --&gt; K[台账状态更新]&#10;  R[RTLS/UWB 标签] --&gt; K&#10;  M[月台作业完成事件] --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; S[秒级看板&lt;br/&gt;新鲜度&lt;30s]&#10;  K --&gt; H[小时级占用率曲线]&#10;  K --&gt; D[周级容量日历]&#10;  S --&gt; A[司机引导/改派]&#10;  H --&gt; B[临时加开月台]&#10;  D --&gt; C[园区扩容决策]\">graph LR\n  G[闸口 OCR/GPS 事件] --&gt; K[台账状态更新]\n  R[RTLS/UWB 标签] --&gt; K\n  M[月台作业完成事件] --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; S[秒级看板&lt;br/&gt;新鲜度&lt;30s]\n  K --&gt; H[小时级占用率曲线]\n  K --&gt; D[周级容量日历]\n  S --&gt; A[司机引导/改派]\n  H --&gt; B[临时加开月台]\n  D --&gt; C[园区扩容决策]</pre><p>数据新鲜度是可视化的隐性成本。事件驱动的更新在高峰期会产生脉冲式负载；定时快照（每 15 秒全量重算）实现简单但会掩盖短暂的双重占用。可行折中是<strong>事件驱动 + 定期校准</strong>：事件负责低延迟，每 5 分钟用一次全量对账（reconciliation）修正漏报与位漂移，差异写入异常池供运营复盘。</p>\n<p>位置精度方面，主流技术的能力边界差别很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>典型精度</th>\n<th>部署成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>闸口 OCR / 车牌识别</td>\n<td>厘米级（固定点位）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>出入场确权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPS 车载终端</td>\n<td>5–15 米</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>园区内粗定位，受遮挡影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UWB / RTLS 标签</td>\n<td>10–30 厘米</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>装卸位级精确占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工扫码确认</td>\n<td>依赖人</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>兜底与异常补录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对绝大多数园区，OCR + GPS 的组合已能支撑到「区域级」精度，而真正的位级占用仍靠作业事件（落箱/提箱）驱动。追求仪表盘上每个点都精确，往往是把成本花在了错误的地方——台账的准确性主要由<strong>状态机与对账机制</strong>决定，而不是定位精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>堆场的正确抽象是<strong>受限容量资源</strong>：物理槽位 → 逻辑槽位 → 容量台账三层，缺一层就只能看平面图，不能做承诺。</li>\n<li>台账的核心是<strong>带时间窗的状态机 + 乐观并发</strong>；<code>OCCUPIED</code> 必须由事件驱动，人工点选只能兜底并标记来源。</li>\n<li>暂存区的本质是<strong>解耦闸口与月台的缓冲池</strong>，其容量由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil \\lambda W \\rceil + B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 决定，利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 必须显著小于 1，否则排队发散。</li>\n<li>容量评估要看<strong>峰值缺口</strong>而非日均；海关扣留的 <code>BLOCKED</code> 占位必须单列，它同时是运营指标和滞期费计费证据（FMC Docket No. 19-04）。</li>\n<li>可视化按<strong>决策时间尺度</strong>分三层（秒/小时/周），准确性主要由状态机与每 5 分钟的对账决定，而非定位精度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把台账做成一条可审计、可对账、可回溯的库存流，而不是一个「占用字段」，是 YMS 从「电子平面图」走向「运力承诺系统」的分界线。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"堆场车位容量台账与暂存区（staging）库存可视化","id":"堆场车位容量台账与暂存区-staging-库存可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：车位是容量资源，不是坐标","id":"核心概念-车位是容量资源-不是坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"容量台账的数据模型与状态机","id":"容量台账的数据模型与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"暂存区（staging）的语义：闸口与月台之间的缓冲池","id":"暂存区-staging-的语义-闸口与月台之间的缓冲池"},{"level":2,"text":"占用率、容量缺口与超额承诺的量化","id":"占用率-容量缺口与超额承诺的量化"},{"level":2,"text":"可视化：从静态平面图到实时数字孪生","id":"可视化-从静态平面图到实时数字孪生"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"月台门类型划分与能力矩阵建模（温控/危化/超限/装卸设备）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/yard-operations-dock-model/dock-door-type-capability-matrix"},"next":{"title":"预约时段、承运商与载具的预约数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/appointment-scheduling-dock-scheduling/appointment-slot-booking-model"}}